{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 21, :comments ["<b>And the priest shall adjure the woman.</b> That she respond Amen after his imprecations." "<b>Your thigh.</b> That is, the house of the womb — as in the phrase ״יוצאי ירך יעקב״ (those who issue from Jacob's thigh). A woman is jealous only of her fellow wife's thigh." "<b>Shall fall.</b> A term of deficiency, as in ״לא נופל אנכי מכם״ — meaning she will no longer be fit for her husband, for the waters will spoil her womb."], :book :numbers, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 5, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:16:37.777499325Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}